  "goodToKnow": "Die Feder has three common meanings: a bird's feather, a pen's nib (die Schreibfeder) and a spring (die Sprungfeder). Idioms: noch in den Federn liegen (to still be in bed), sich mit fremden Federn schmücken (to take credit for others' work). Federleicht means light as a feather. Das Federbett is a feather-filled duvet, and der Federball is the shuttlecock, or casual badminton."
